From 265c90719dfb3fc499de16f3babfb40e857b6a8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 09:13:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 62/90] PartDesign: any tool on an imported solid without
 asking for a body

The previous change covered only new sketches. In the integrated
environment getBody() now makes a part from the picked solid whenever a
tool needs an active body and the picked faces, edges or vertices belong
to one solid outside any part, so fillets, chamfers, pads from a face,
... work on imported shapes directly. The same elements are picked on
the part's base shape.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
